| `ci_pipeline.steps[].run` | string | the editable install, then the `make` targets the CI section of `docs/guides/deterministic-checks.md` lists, in that order | a shell line; the list is not empty | `tests/ci_adapters.py`; `tests/integration/test_ci_pipeline_gate.py` | Sets what every CI adapter runs, in order; the gate fails an adapter that drops, adds, reorders or changes a step, and an empty list. Change a step here and in every adapter the project ships. | what `make verify` runs locally: the Makefile's `verify` recipe | always |
